physicalRef: contract_change/database
description: "Bid rigging and procurement fraud Link Analysis showcase - One row per approved contract change (a variation that raises the contract value): tender, the value added, the official who approved it and the day. One landed extract; the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the contract_change Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: approved_at
columns[5]{name,type,classification}:
